<title>USA: New York physical copper market.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for October shipment were quoted at a nominal 96.40 to 96.90 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 75.00 cents, up 1 cent from October 29th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
